            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Approve/Reject time-off requests in batch. The request body should contain a list of time-off IDs and the desired status (either APPROVED or REJECTED). The response will indicate which requests were successfully processed and which ones encountered errors.\n **Token scopes**: `time-off:write`"
